<title>USA: Anderson Cty., Tenn., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Anderson Cty., Tenn., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said it won $17.340 million of Anderson Cty, Tenn., various school bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.25 percent.</p>
